Build a Custom AI Assistant Without Writing a Single Prompt. Turn your subject matter expertise into a professional, ready-to-deploy AI assistant in minutes. This guided system prompt-builder walks you through a friendly, structured interview and hands you a polished, platform-ready system prompt you can drop straight into Copilot, Gemini, ChatGPT, or Claude. No technical experience is necessary.

 Designed especially for high-stakes fields like research administration, legal, finance, and healthcare, it automatically builds in the right guardrails: source discipline, compliance-first defaults, and a "human always makes the final call" safeguard so your assistant stays trustworthy. It even speaks your language—literally—adapting the entire experience and final output to whatever language you work in. Whether you're answering policy questions, drafting documents, evaluating compliance, or guiding a team through a process, you'll walk away with a clear name, description, system prompt / instructions, and a ready-to-use starter prompt. This is everything you need to launch with confidence.

The system instructions are AI tool agnostic, so you can easily implement them into your preferred platform, including:

Gemini (Gems)
Claude (Projects)
ChatGPT (GPTs)
